      "payload": {
        "progress": "Added --json to update/review/stop/done/drop (matching acceptance criteria) plus draft/undraft nice-to-have. Stable shapes: id/slug/handle/name/state[+priority] consistently, done/drop expose unblocked (TicketId[]) and problems ({id,message}[]) instead of prose, review nests {mr,requested_at,by} matching show's ticket.review shape. Added in-process tests per command + docs/cli-reference.md updates. Full suite (1903 tests) + lint/typecheck/format/build all pass."
